<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys shares on market at $6.70/71.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys shares on market at $6.70/71.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom New Zealand Limited said on Wednesday it bought 618,700 shares on the market as part of its ongoing buyback scheme, at prices ranging between NZ$6.70 and $6.71.</p>
<p>The operation is set to continue until the company advises it has concluded the current phase of purchases.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
</text>
